{"arm": "vs", "model": "openai/gpt-6-luna", "i": 1, "finish": "stop", "dirs": [{"direction": "Calm coastal minimalism \u2014 soft sea-glass colors, generous whitespace, and quiet typography make weekly planning feel unhurried.", "probability": 0.28}, {"direction": "Playful team workshop \u2014 bold color blocks, hand-drawn accents, and lively illustrations make collaboration feel energetic.", "probability": 0.22}, {"direction": "Editorial productivity \u2014 refined typography, strong grid layouts, and thoughtful copy position Tidepool as a considered work ritual.", "probability": 0.2}, {"direction": "Product-first dashboard \u2014 a crisp, realistic interface preview leads the page, emphasizing how the shared weekly plan works.", "probability": 0.18}, {"direction": "Retro-futurist tide charts \u2014 dark ocean tones, luminous accents, and wave-inspired data visuals give planning a distinctive technical edge.", "probability": 0.12}], "pick": {"direction": "Product-first dashboard \u2014 a crisp, realistic interface preview leads the page, emphasizing how the shared weekly plan works.", "probability": 0.18}, "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#f7f9f6\">\n  <title>Tidepool \u2014 Make a week that works</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --ink: #183632;\n      --muted: #71817c;\n      --green: #176b5a;\n      --green-dark: #125448;\n      --mint: #e8f3ed;\n      --line: #e8ece8;\n      --paper: #ffffff;\n      --canvas: #f7f9f6;\n      --coral: #e88d72;\n      --shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(27, 58, 49, .12), 0 4px 14px rgba(27, 58, 49, .06);\n    }\n\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      color: var(--ink);\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 10%, rgba(218, 239, 227, .55), transparent 42%),\n        var(--canvas);\n      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    }\n\n    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }\n\n    .site-header {\n      width: min(1220px, calc(100% - 56px));\n      height: 78px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n\n    .brand {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-size: 19px;\n      font-weight: 750;\n      letter-spacing: -.7px;\n    }\n\n    .brand-mark {\n      display: grid;\n      width: 33px;\n      height: 33px;\n      place-items: center;\n      border-radius: 11px;\n      color: white;\n      background: var(--green);\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(23, 107, 90, .2);\n    }\n\n    .brand-mark svg { width: 21px; height: 21px; }\n\n    .nav-links {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 34px;\n      color: #63736e;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--green); }\n\n    .header-cta {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      min-height: 40px;\n      padding: 0 17px;\n      color: white;\n      background: var(--green);\n      border-radius: 9px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 650;\n      transition: background .2s, transform .2s;\n    }\n\n    .header-cta:hover, .button-primary:hover {\n      background: var(--green-dark);\n      transform: translateY(-1px);\n    }\n\n    .hero {\n      width: min(1220px, calc(100% - 56px));\n      margin: 49px auto 0;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .eyebrow {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      padding: 7px 11px;\n      color: #3e7567;\n      background: #eaf4ed;\n      border: 1px solid #dcebe0;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: .06em;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .eyebrow-dot {\n      width: 7px;\n      height: 7px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #59a487;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(89, 164, 135, .13);\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      max-width: 800px;\n      margin: 19px auto 12px;\n      color: #183a34;\n      font-size: clamp(42px, 5.1vw, 66px);\n      line-height: 1.03;\n      letter-spacing: -.065em;\n      font-weight: 720;\n    }\n\n    .hero-copy {\n      max-width: 540px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      color: #71817c;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.65;\n      letter-spacing: -.01em;\n    }\n\n    .hero-actions {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 19px;\n      margin: 22px 0 29px;\n    }\n\n    .button-primary {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      gap: 9px;\n      min-height: 45px;\n      padding: 0 19px;\n      color: white;\n      background: var(--green);\n      border-radius: 9px;\n      box-shadow: 0 5px 12px rgba(23, 107, 90, .15);\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      transition: background .2s, transform .2s;\n    }\n\n    .button-primary svg { width: 15px; height: 15px; }\n\n    .hero-note {\n      color: #81908b;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 550;\n    }\n\n    .preview-wrap {\n      position: relative;\n      width: min(1160px, 100%);\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      text-align: left;\n    }\n\n    .preview-wrap::before,\n    .preview-wrap::after {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: -1;\n      content: \"\";\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      filter: blur(1px);\n    }\n\n    .preview-wrap::before {\n      width: 180px;\n      height: 180px;\n      top: 60px;\n      left: -88px;\n      background: rgba(223, 239, 229, .8);\n    }\n\n    .preview-wrap::after {\n      width: 130px;\n      height: 130px;\n      right: -45px;\n      bottom: 70px;\n      background: rgba(250, 228, 216, .65);\n    }\n\n    .browser-frame {\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background: var(--paper);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(32, 74, 62, .11);\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n    }\n\n    .browser-bar {\n      height: 36px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 0 13px;\n      gap: 6px;\n      background: #fbfcfa;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #edf0ed;\n    }\n\n    .browser-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #d7ded9; }\n    .browser-dot:first-child { background: #e7a795; }\n    .browser-dot:nth-child(2) { background: #e7c77e; }\n    .browser-dot:nth-child(3) { background: #8fc4a5; }\n\n    .address-bar {\n      width: 210px;\n      height: 19px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      gap: 5px;\n      color: #9aa6a0;\n      background: #f1f4f1;\n      border-radius: 5px;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      letter-spacing: .01em;\n    }\n\n    .address-bar svg { width: 10px; height: 10px; }\n\n    .app {\n      min-height: 490px;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 174px minmax(0, 1fr);\n      color: #253d37;\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n\n    .sidebar {\n      padding: 17px 12px 15px;\n      background: #fbfcfa;\n      border-right: 1px solid #edf0ed;\n    }\n\n    .workspace-switcher {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 9px;\n      padding: 0 5px 17px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #edf0ed;\n    }\n\n    .workspace-icon {\n      display: grid;\n      width: 29px;\n      height: 29px;\n      place-items: center;\n      color: #fff;\n      background: #e89176;\n      border-radius: 9px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 750;\n    }\n\n    .workspace-name { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; }\n    .workspace-sub { margin-top: 3px; color: #929e98; font-size: 9px; }\n    .chevron { margin-left: auto; color: #91a099; font-size: 12px; }\n\n    .side-label {\n      margin: 18px 7px 8px;\n      color: #9aa59f;\n      font-size: 8px;\n      font-weight: 750;\n      letter-spacing: .1em;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .side-link {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 9px;\n      height: 31px;\n      padding: 0 8px;\n      margin: 2px 0;\n      color: #75847e;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      font-weight: 550;\n    }\n\n    .side-link svg { width: 13px; height: 13px; opacity: .8; }\n    .side-link.active { color: #246b59; background: #eaf4ed; font-weight: 700; }\n\n    .side-count {\n      margin-left: auto;\n      color: #899790;\n      font-size: 9px;\n    }\n\n    .team-row {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 7px;\n      padding: 5px 7px;\n      color: #75847e;\n      font-size: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .tiny-avatar {\n      width: 18px;\n      height: 18px;\n      display: grid;\n      flex: 0 0 auto;\n      place-items: center;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      color: #48675a;\n      background: #e3eee5;\n      font-size: 7px;\n      font-weight: 750;\n    }\n\n    .tiny-avatar.peach { color: #9e6252; background: #f8e6dc; }\n    .tiny-avatar.blue { color: #506b87; background: #e2edf4; }\n    .tiny-avatar.lilac { color: #746087; background: #eee7f4; }\n\n    .app-main { min-width: 0; }\n\n    .app-topbar {\n      height: 52px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 21px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #edf0ed;\n    }\n\n    .crumb {\n      color: #9aa59f;\n      font-size: 9px;\n    }\n\n    .crumb strong { color: #364d46; font-weight: 700; }\n\n    .topbar-tools { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }\n\n    .icon-button {\n      width: 25px;\n      height: 25px;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n      color: #7e8c86;\n      background: #fff;\n      border: 1px solid #e9eeea;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n    }\n\n    .icon-button svg { width: 12px; height: 12px; }\n\n    .invite-button {\n      height: 27px;\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 5px;\n      padding: 0 9px;\n      color: #fff;\n      background: #1c6b59;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      font-weight: 650;\n    }\n\n    .invite-button svg { width: 11px; height: 11px; }\n\n    .app-content { padding: 20px 21px 18px; }\n\n    .week-heading {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 12px;\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .week-heading h2 {\n      margin: 0;\n      color: #203d36;\n      font-size: 20px;\n      line-height: 1.2;\n      letter-spacing: -.045em;\n    }\n\n    .week-heading p {\n      margin: 5px 0 0;\n      color: #89968f;\n      font-size: 9px;\n    }\n\n    .week-controls { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }\n\n    .week-select, .arrow-button {\n      height: 27px;\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n      padding: 0 9px;\n      color: #61716a;\n      background: #fff;\n      border: 1px solid #e7ece8;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .arrow-button { width: 27px; padding: 0; font-size: 14px; }\n\n    .week-summary {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 15px;\n      min-height: 51px;\n      padding: 9px 12px;\n      margin-bottom: 14px;\n      background: #f7faf7;\n      border: 1px solid #edf1ed;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .summary-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-width: 0; }\n\n    .summary-icon {\n      width: 29px;\n      height: 29px;\n      display: grid;\n      flex: 0 0 auto;\n      place-items: center;\n      color: #46826c;\n      background: #e4f0e7;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .summary-icon svg { width: 15px; height: 15px; }\n\n    .summary-title { color: #53655d; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; }\n    .summary-subtitle { margin-top: 3px; color: #98a39d; font-size: 8px; }\n\n    .summary-progress { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }\n    .progress-label { color: #728079; font-size: 8px; white-space: nowrap; }\n    .progress-track { width: 72px; height: 5px; overflow: hidden; background: #e4ebe5; border-radius: 5px; }\n    .progress-fill { width: 64%; height: 100%; background: #63a184; border-radius: inherit; }\n\n    .board-toolbar {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      margin: 0 0 8px;\n    }\n\n    .board-label {\n      color: #52635c;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .board-people { display: flex; align-items: center; }\n    .board-people .tiny-avatar { margin-left: -4px; border: 2px solid white; width: 20px; height: 20px; }\n    .board-people .tiny-avatar:first-child { margin-left: 0; }\n\n    .add-task {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 4px;\n      margin-left: 8px;\n      color: #6b7d74;\n      font-size: 8px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .add-task b { color: #45846b; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; }\n\n    .week-board {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));\n      border: 1px solid #e9eeea;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .day-column {\n      min-width: 0;\n      min-height: 285px;\n      padding: 9px 7px;\n      background: #fff;\n      border-right: 1px solid #edf0ed;\n    }\n\n    .day-column:last-child { border-right: 0; }\n\n    .day-head {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 2px 9px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #eff2ef;\n    }\n\n    .day-name {\n      color: #64746c;\n      font-size: 8px;\n      font-weight: 750;\n      letter-spacing: .04em;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .day-date { color: #a0aaa4; font-size: 8px; }\n    .day-date.today { display: grid; width: 19px; height: 19px; place-items: center; color: #fff; background: #39816a; border-radius: 50%; }\n\n    .task-card {\n      padding: 8px 7px 7px;\n      margin-top: 7px;\n      background: #f7f9f7;\n      border: 1px solid #edf0ed;\n      border-left: 2px solid #7bb397;\n      border-radius: 5px;\n    }\n\n    .task-card.coral { border-left-color: #e6a084; }\n    .task-card.blue { border-left-color: #8eafc1; }\n    .task-card.lilac { border-left-color: #aa9ac0; }\n    .task-card.yellow { border-left-color: #d5b465; }\n    .task-card.done { background: #fbfcfb; opacity: .72; }\n\n    .task-time {\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\n      color: #9aa69f;\n      font-size: 7px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .task-title {\n      color: #40564d;\n      font-size: 8px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 1.35;\n    }\n\n    .task-meta {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 4px;\n      margin-top: 7px;\n    }\n\n    .task-tag {\n      padding: 3px 5px;\n      color: #688674;\n      background: #eaf3eb;\n      border-radius: 3px;\n      font-size: 6px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .task-tag.coral-tag { color: #9b705e; background: #f8eee8; }\n    .task-tag.blue-tag { color: #607c8b; background: #eaf1f4; }\n    .task-tag.purple-tag { color: #796b8b; background: #f0ecf5; }\n\n    .task-avatar {\n      width: 16px;\n      height: 16px;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      color: #53715f;\n      background: #e3eee5;\n      font-size: 6px;\n      font-weight: 750;\n    }\n\n    .task-avatar.peach { color: #9e6252; background: #f8e6dc; }\n    .task-avatar.blue { color: #506b87; background: #e2edf4; }\n    .task-avatar.lilac { color: #746087; background: #eee7f4; }\n\n    .board-footer {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 10px 2px 0;\n      color: #97a29c;\n      font-size: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .board-footer strong { color: #61766a; font-weight: 650; }\n\n    .below {\n      width: min(900px, calc(100% - 48px));\n      margin: 34px auto 70px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      gap: 32px;\n      color: #7a8982;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 550;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .below-item { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }\n    .check {\n      display: grid;\n      width: 17px;\n      height: 17px;\n      place-items: center;\n      color: #4b8a70;\n      background: #e6f1e8;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 760px) {\n      .site-header { width: min(100% - 34px, 1220px); height: 68px; }\n      .nav-links { gap: 16px; }\n      .nav-links a:not(.header-cta) { display: none; }\n      .hero { width: calc(100% - 32px); margin-top: 37px; }\n      h1 { max-width: 560px; }\n      .hero-copy { max-width: 460px; font-size: 14px; }\n      .preview-wrap { width: calc(100vw - 26px); margin-left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); }\n      .app { grid-template-columns: 135px minmax(0, 1fr); }\n      .sidebar { padding-left: 9px; padding-right: 9px; }\n      .app-content { padding: 17px 14px; }\n      .app-topbar { padding: 0 14px; }\n      .day-column { padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; }\n      .task-card { padding: 7px 5px; }\n      .task-title { font-size: 7px; }\n      .task-tag { font-size: 5px; }\n      .below { gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 29px; }\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 560px) {\n      .brand { font-size: 17px; }\n      .header-cta { min-height: 36px; padding: 0 12px; font-size: 11px; }\n      .hero { margin-top: 28px; }\n      h1 { font-size: clamp(39px, 11vw, 52px); }\n      .hero-copy { font-size: 13px; }\n      .hero-actions { flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin: 19px 0 23px; }\n      .button-primary { min-height: 43px; }\n      .browser-frame { border-radius: 11px; }\n      .app { grid-template-columns: 1fr; min-height: auto; }\n      .sidebar { display: none; }\n      .app-topbar { height: 44px; }\n      .app-content { padding: 15px 11px 13px; }\n      .week-heading h2 { font-size: 17px; }\n      .week-heading p { font-size: 8px; }\n      .week-controls { gap: 4px; }\n      .week-select { padding: 0 6px; font-size: 8px; }\n      .week-summary { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; }\n      .summary-progress { justify-content: flex-start; padding-left: 39px; }\n      .progress-track { width: 100px; }\n      .week-board { overflow-x: auto; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 112px); }\n      .day-column { min-height: 267px; padding: 9px 7px; }\n      .task-title { font-size: 8px; }\n      .task-tag { font-size: 6px; }\n      .below { width: calc(100% - 28px); margin-bottom: 40px; font-size: 10px; }\n      .below-item { justify-content: center; }\n    }\n\n    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n      *, *::before, *::after { scroll-behavior: auto !important; transition: none !important; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Tidepool home\">\n      <span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n          <path d=\"M3 9.5c2.3 0 2.3-2 4.7-2s2.3 2 4.6 2 2.4-2 4.7-2 2.4 2 4.7 2M3 15c2.3 0 2.3-2 4.7-2s2.3 2 4.6 2 2.4-2 4.7-2 2.4 2 4.7 2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </span>\n      tidepool\n    </a>\n    <nav class=\"nav-links\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\">\n      <a href=\"#how-it-works\">How it works</a>\n      <a href=\"#teams\">For teams</a>\n      <a class=\"header-cta\" href=\"#get-started\">Get started</a>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <section class=\"hero\" id=\"how-it-works\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\"></span> A calmer way to work together</div>\n      <h1>Make a week that<br>works for everyone.</h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-copy\">One shared plan for your team's priorities, projects, and people. Get on the same page, then get on with your week.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-actions\" id=\"get-started\">\n        <a class=\"button-primary\" href=\"mailto:hello@tidepool.team\">\n          Plan your first week\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 10h11m-4-4 4 4-4 4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n        </a>\n        <span class=\"hero-note\">Free for small teams \u00b7 No credit card needed</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"preview-wrap\" aria-label=\"Preview of the Tidepool shared weekly plan\">\n        <div class=\"browser-frame\">\n          <div class=\"browser-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <span class=\"browser-dot\"></span><span class=\"browser-dot\"></span><span class=\"browser-dot\"></span>\n            <div class=\"address-bar\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"3.2\" y=\"6.5\" width=\"9.6\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><path d=\"M5.4 6.4V4.8a2.6 2.6 0 0 1 5.2 0v1.6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n              app.tidepool.team / week\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"app\">\n            <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n              <div class=\"workspace-switcher\">\n                <div class=\"workspace-icon\">S</div>\n                <div>\n                  <div class=\"workspace-name\">Studio North</div>\n                  <div class=\"workspace-sub\">Team workspace</div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"chevron\">\u2304</span>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"side-label\">Workspace</div>\n              <div class=\"side-link active\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"14\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M6.5 2.8v3M13.5 2.8v3M3 8h14\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n                Weekly plan\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"side-link\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 5.5h12M4 10h12M4 14.5h8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"2.5\" cy=\"5.5\" r=\".7\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"2.5\" cy=\"10\" r=\".7\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"2.5\" cy=\"14.5\" r=\".7\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n                All tasks <span class=\"side-count\">18</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"side-link\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M10 3a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 6.5 6.5M10 5v4l2.5 1.5M13 3h4v4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n                Check-ins\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"side-label\">Your team</div>\n              <div class=\"team-row\"><span class=\"tiny-avatar\">JM</span> Jamie Morgan</div>\n              <div class=\"team-row\"><span class=\"tiny-avatar peach\">AL</span> Alex Lee</div>\n              <div class=\"team-row\"><span class=\"tiny-avatar blue\">SK</span> Sam Kim</div>\n              <div class=\"team-row\"><span class=\"tiny-avatar lilac\">RD</span> Riley Diaz</div>\n            </aside>\n\n            <section class=\"app-main\">\n              <div class=\"app-topbar\">\n                <div class=\"crumb\">Studio North <span style=\"padding:0 5px;color:#c2cbc5\">/</span> <strong>Weekly plan</strong></div>\n                <div class=\"topbar-tools\">\n                  <button class=\"icon-button\" aria-label=\"Search\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"8.8\" cy=\"8.8\" r=\"5.3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"m12.8 12.8 3.4 3.4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n                  </button>\n                  <button class=\"icon-button\" aria-label=\"Notifications\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M15 7.7a5 5 0 0 0-10 0c0 5-2 5-2 6.3h14c0-1.3-2-1.3-2-6.3ZM8 16.5h4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n                  </button>\n                  <a class=\"invite-button\" href=\"#teams\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M10 4v12M4 10h12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n                    Invite\n                  </a>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"app-content\">\n                <div class=\"week-heading\">\n                  <div>\n                    <h2>Weekly plan</h2>\n                    <p>Make room for the work that matters.</p>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"week-controls\">\n                    <button class=\"arrow-button\" aria-label=\"Previous week\">\u2039</button>\n                    <button class=\"week-select\">May 13 \u2013 17 <span>\u2304</span></button>\n                    <button class=\"arrow-button\" aria-label=\"Next week\">\u203a</button>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"week-summary\">\n                  <div class=\"summary-left\">\n                    <div class=\"summary-icon\">\n                      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"m5 10 3.1 3.1L15.5 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                      <div class=\"summary-title\">This week's focus: Launch the new look</div>\n                      <div class=\"summary-subtitle\">A shared priority to keep the whole team moving together</div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"summary-progress\">\n                    <span class=\"progress-label\">Team progress <strong>64%</strong></span>\n                    <div class=\"progress-track\"><div class=\"progress-fill\"></div></div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"board-toolbar\">\n                  <span class=\"board-label\">Team schedule</span>\n                  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center\">\n                    <div class=\"board-people\" aria-label=\"Four team members\">\n                      <span class=\"tiny-avatar\">JM</span>\n                      <span class=\"tiny-avatar peach\">AL</span>\n                      <span class=\"tiny-avatar blue\">SK</span>\n                      <span class=\"tiny-avatar lilac\">RD</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"add-task\"><b>\uff0b</b> Add task</span>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"week-board\">\n                  <div class=\"day-column\">\n                    <div class=\"day-head\"><span class=\"day-name\">Mon</span><span class=\"day-date\">13</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"task-card done\">\n                      <div class=\"task-time\">9:30 \u2013 10:00</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-title\">Weekly team sync</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-meta\"><span class=\"task-tag\">Team</span><span class=\"task-avatar\">JM</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"task-card coral\">\n                      <div class=\"task-time\">11:00 \u2013 12:30</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-title\">Map launch story</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-meta\"><span class=\"task-tag coral-tag\">Brand</span><span class=\"task-avatar peach\">AL</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"task-card blue\">\n                      <div class=\"task-time\">2:00 \u2013 3:00</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-title\">Review user notes</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-meta\"><span class=\"task-tag blue-tag\">Research</span><span class=\"task-avatar blue\">SK</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n\n                  <div class=\"day-column\">\n                    <div class=\"day-head\"><span class=\"day-name\">Tue</span><span class=\"day-date today\">14</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"task-card\">\n                      <div class=\"task-time\">10:00 \u2013 11:30</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-title\">Homepage concepts</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-meta\"><span class=\"task-tag coral-tag\">Brand</span><span class=\"task-avatar peach\">AL</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"task-card lilac\">\n                      <div class=\"task-time\">1:00 \u2013 1:30</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-title\">Pair on onboarding</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-meta\"><span class=\"task-tag purple-tag\">Product</span><span class=\"task-avatar lilac\">RD</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"task-card yellow\">\n                      <div class=\"task-time\">3:00 \u2013 4:00</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-title\">Prep launch checklist</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-meta\"><span class=\"task-tag\">Launch</span><span class=\"task-avatar\">JM</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n\n                  <div class=\"day-column\">\n                    <div class=\"day-head\"><span class=\"day-name\">Wed</span><span class=\"day-date\">15</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"task-card blue\">\n                      <div class=\"task-time\">9:00 \u2013 10:00</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-title\">Prototype testing</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-meta\"><span class=\"task-tag blue-tag\">Research</span><span class=\"task-avatar blue\">SK</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"task-card coral\">\n                      <div class=\"task-time\">11:30 \u2013 12:30</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-title\">Visual direction review</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-meta\"><span class=\"task-tag coral-tag\">Brand</span><span class=\"task-avatar peach\">AL</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"task-card\">\n                      <div class=\"task-time\">2:00 \u2013 3:30</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-title\">Build landing page</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-meta\"><span class=\"task-tag purple-tag\">Product</span><span class=\"task-avatar lilac\">RD</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n\n                  <div class=\"day-column\">\n                    <div class=\"day-head\"><span class=\"day-name\">Thu</span><span class=\"day-date\">16</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"task-card yellow\">\n                      <div class=\"task-time\">9:30 \u2013 10:00</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-title\">Midweek check-in</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-meta\"><span class=\"task-tag\">Team</span><span class=\"task-avatar\">JM</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"task-card\">\n                      <div class=\"task-time\">11:00 \u2013 12:30</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-title\">Polish key screens</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-meta\"><span class=\"task-tag purple-tag\">Product</span><span class=\"task-avatar lilac\">RD</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"task-card blue\">\n                      <div class=\"task-time\">2:00 \u2013 3:00</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-title\">Share research takeaways</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-meta\"><span class=\"task-tag blue-tag\">Research</span><span class=\"task-avatar blue\">SK</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n\n                  <div class=\"day-column\">\n                    <div class=\"day-head\"><span class=\"day-name\">Fri</span><span class=\"day-date\">17</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"task-card coral\">\n                      <div class=\"task-time\">10:00 \u2013 11:00</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-title\">Final design handoff</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-meta\"><span class=\"task-tag coral-tag\">Brand</span><span class=\"task-avatar peach\">AL</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"task-card\">\n                      <div class=\"task-time\">1:00 \u2013 2:00</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-title\">Demo &amp; celebrate \ud83c\udf89</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-meta\"><span class=\"task-tag\">Team</span><span class=\"task-avatar\">JM</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"task-card done\">\n                      <div class=\"task-time\">2:30 \u2013 3:00</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-title\">Wrap-up &amp; next week</div>\n                      <div class=\"task-meta\"><span class=\"task-tag\">Planning</span><span class=\"task-avatar lilac\">RD</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"board-footer\">\n                  <span><strong>18 tasks</strong> planned across 4 people</span>\n                  <span>Updated just now \u00b7 All changes saved</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </section>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"below\" id=\"teams\" aria-label=\"Tidepool benefits\">\n      <span class=\"below-item\"><span class=\"check\">\u2713</span> Everyone knows what matters</span>\n      <span class=\"below-item\"><span class=\"check\">\u2713</span> Plans stay flexible as the week changes</span>\n      <span class=\"below-item\"><span class=\"check\">\u2713</span> Built for small, thoughtful teams</span>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}